{{also|tina|tína}}
==English==

===Etymology===
Short form of {{l|en|Christina}} or of any female name ending in -tina, such as {{l|en|Martina}} or {{l|en|Albertina}}.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{given name|female|from=Ancient Greek}}.
# A [[lake]] in [[Alaska]], near/around [[Anchorage]].

===Anagrams===
* [[ain't#English|ain't]] 
* [[anti#English|anti]]
* [[NAIT#English|NAIT]]
* [[tian#English|tian]]

